Subject: [PATCH] nvn: support bounded overlapping linear texture rows and
 retire timestamp reports

Upstream-Status: pending
Reason: Short-pitch textures abort Skyrim New Game and timestamp reports can stall movie startup.
Issue: seedds/nxnative#148
